			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3718113">
									

<p>This feels&#8230; okay?<br />
I will admit that I was expecting something else from the title, but this isn't necessarily a bad idea. Here's what I think: The writing could use some polishing/feedback, and whatever 'hidden story' there is seems to well-hidden and esoteric given the number of people that know Morse Code in this day and age.</p>
<p>The idea seems a bit thin, and some of the wording (&quot;the burning down of a house&quot;) is weird. Also, individuals related to an SCP usually aren't given SCP classification. SCP-XXXX-X formatting is usually reserved for sub-parts of an SCP that also have anamalous properties. See <a href="/scp-004">SCP-004</a> and <a href="/scp-072">SCP-072</a> for examples.</p>
<p>I'm sorry if this is rude, I just want this SCP to be good.</p>

